function showPanel(id,toggle=false){if(id==='mobile'){mobile?.editor();return;}if(id==='install'){pwa?.show();return;}const show=({map:showMap,quest:showJournal,person:showCharacter,book:showBook,bag:showInventory,base:showBase,guide:showGuide,menu:showGameMenu,clan:showClan,admin:showAdmin,talents:showTalents})[id];if(!show)return;const windowId=({talents:'person',clan:'person',book:'person',base:'quest',menu:'guide'})[id]||id;if(['person','bag','book','quest','base','map','guide'].includes(windowId))lastTab=windowId;if(toggle&&popups.isOpen(windowId)&&!['talents','clan','menu','book','base'].includes(id)){popups.close(windowId);return;}show();popups.focus(windowId);}
